<section class="services_section" id="what-we-do"><div class="section-inner"><h2 class="section_h2">What we do</h2><ul class="services_grid" role="list"><li><article class="services_card"><h3 class="services_card-h3">Stablecoin issuance and governance</h3><p class="services_card-desc">Issuance and controls a regulated issuer can operate.</p><ul class="services_bullets" role="list"><li class="services_bullet"><div aria-hidden="true" class="services_bullet-arrow">→</div><div>Role separation, freeze and clawback</div></li><li class="services_bullet"><div aria-hidden="true" class="services_bullet-arrow">→</div><div>Allow and deny lists, alerting-to-freeze automation</div></li><li class="services_bullet"><div aria-hidden="true" class="services_bullet-arrow">→</div><div>Mint and burn bridges to core banking</div></li></ul><div class="services_precedent"><div class="services_precedent-label">Precedent</div><div class="inline-text"> EURCV; a US bank's settlement stablecoin</div></div></article></li><li><article class="services_card"><h3 class="services_card-h3">Tokenized funds and deposits</h3><p class="services_card-desc">Fund units and deposits mapped to the legal structure.</p><ul class="services_bullets" role="list"><li class="services_bullet"><div aria-hidden="true" class="services_bullet-arrow">→</div><div>Transfer restrictions enforced onchain</div></li><li class="services_bullet"><div aria-hidden="true" class="services_bullet-arrow">→</div><div>Subscriptions and redemptions onchain</div></li><li class="services_bullet"><div aria-hidden="true" class="services_bullet-arrow">→</div><div>Custody integration</div></li></ul><div class="services_precedent"><div class="services_precedent-label">Precedent</div><div class="inline-text" data-rv="precedent-fund"> A tokenized share class of a money market fund for a regulated European asset manager, in build</div></div></article></li><li><article class="services_card"><h3 class="services_card-h3">Protocol and product integration